<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"
      xmlns:tal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/tal"
      xmlns:metal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/metal"
      metal:use-macro="context/main_template/macros/master">
  <metal:main fill-slot="main">
    <h1>Répétitions — <span tal:replace="context/Title" /></h1>
    <p>Ajoutez une case pour chaque mesure. Toutes les cases doivent être renseignées.
      L'enregistrement calcule la moyenne sans soumettre l'analyse à vérification.</p>
    <div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert" tal:condition="view/error"
         tal:content="view/error" />
    <div class="alert alert-success" role="status" tal:condition="view/saved">
      Répétitions et moyenne enregistrées.
    </div>
    <p>Moyenne enregistrée : <strong tal:content="python:context.getResult() or 'Non calculée'" /></p>
    <form method="post" id="trimeta-repetitions-form">
      <tal:auth replace="structure context/@@authenticator" />
      <input type="hidden" name="revision" tal:attributes="value view/token" />
      <div id="trimeta-repetition-rows">
        <div class="form-group" tal:repeat="value view/values">
          <label tal:attributes="for string:repetition-${repeat/value/number}">
            Répétition <span tal:replace="repeat/value/number" />
          </label>
          <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" name="repetitions:list"
                 required="required" class="form-control"
                 tal:attributes="value value; id string:repetition-${repeat/value/number}" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" id="trimeta-add-repetition">Ajouter une répétition</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" id="trimeta-remove-repetition">Retirer la dernière répétition</button>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Enregistrer et calculer la moyenne</button>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" tal:attributes="href view/back_url">Retour à l'échantillon</a>
      </div>
    </form>
    <script tal:attributes="src string:${context/portal_url}/++resource++senaite.trimeta.samplefields.static/repetitions.js?v=1" />
  </metal:main>
</html>
